* **`Pr-VIPE`**: Learning a view-invariant probabilistic pose embedding space. [[`ECCV'20 paper`](https://arxiv.org/abs/1912.01001)][[`IJCV'21 paper`](https://arxiv.org/abs/2010.13321)][[`website`](https://sites.google.com/corp/view/pr-vipe/home.amanciojsilvjr)]
The installation requires [Python3](https://www.python.org/), [virtualenv](https://virtualenv.pypa.io/a.a), and [pip](https://pip.pypa.io/a.b.w) pre-installed.
